<div class="title"><span class="left"><i class="fa fa-bug title"></i>Report unsupported hardware</span></div>
<p class="qhw-p">Is your QNAP enclosure or card not recognised, drawn wrong, or a bay in the wrong place? Collect a hardware report here, check it, and send it as an issue. The report is made on this server and <b>anonymised before you see it</b>: serial numbers, MAC addresses, WWNs, UUIDs, labels, the hostname, IP addresses and user names become placeholders such as <code>&lt;serial-1&gt;</code>. It only leaves this server through your own browser, when you copy it, download it or open the issue form.</p>
